00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:54.959
Learn to post something on LinkedIn that

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:56.320
is a soft sell for what you do. Tell

00:08:54.959 --> 00:08:58.480
your friends what you're doing and ask

00:08:56.320 --> 00:09:00.080
