00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:01.519
Selling is just communication. It's just

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:03.120
storytelling. I've got a book called

00:09:01.519 --> 00:09:04.640
What's Your Story? If you want to learn

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:06.640
how to tell stories, which is a huge,

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:07.760
huge part of selling, you can buy the

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:09.200
book. The link's down below. And I used

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:10.560
the profit from this book to fund dreams

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:13.440
just like yours. But what I'm getting to

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:14.880
is like be brave. Go and sell something.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:16.399
That's an important step to prove that

00:09:14.880 --> 00:09:18.560
there's a market for your business. The

00:09:16.399 --> 00:09:21.200
next thing you need to do, and this is

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:22.560
