00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:33.360
tell you why. Most of the businesses

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:36.240
I've built, started off, my first hire

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:38.640
is my co-founder. I love co-founders.

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:40.320
I'd rather have 50% of something I love

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:41.839
