00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:43.279
where I'm struggling to have people in

00:09:41.839 --> 00:09:44.959
the business. and struggling to make it

00:09:43.279 --> 00:09:47.360
work. I'm struggling to make the 100%

00:09:44.959 --> 00:09:49.279
equity worth anything. Co-founders is

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:50.720
one of the biggest hacks as your first

00:09:49.279 --> 00:09:52.720
employee. Frankly, it can be the second

