that we're building now to help you with

00:09:55.519 --> 00:09:59.440
your business all have equity. Again, I

00:09:57.839 --> 00:10:00.480
think people aren't leveraging equity in

00:09:59.440 --> 00:10:01.680
the early days in the way that they

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:03.040
could. People are too scared that that

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:04.959
