00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:06.320
clawback. If people leave, they have to

00:10:04.959 --> 00:10:08.560
give up the equity. There's all sorts of

00:10:06.320 --> 00:10:10.800
ways you can manage it, but I think

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:11.777
people should give equity to their first

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:12.160
few employees.

00:10:11.777 --> 00:10:13.440
>> [music]

00:10:12.160 --> 00:10:15.360
>> I would think everybody in the company

