00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:20.880
to be important. And this is the basic

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:22.959
framework. What are you good at? What

00:10:20.880 --> 00:10:25.360
are you bad at? What gives you energy,

00:10:22.959 --> 00:10:27.519
what takes you energy? Make a list. And

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:29.760
make sure whatever takes you energy and

00:10:27.519 --> 00:10:32.079
